SkB1nmTayn25S_SWHSpm3tn_uGpe8VjxBdLPJcyH4Ypg&oe=6AEC9D44"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "467916352871409", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003282_467916356204742_1871921057092171900_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MgUAaWxKuxoQ7kNvwHojYI-&_nc_oc=AdoYFftheDNjzYjJHQgP_0IFP69PaR_-3OnN9vjAFhp9kL5FeB5wSM7w_kZzkCmJ-lw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQkBixJq9MbthKcOrN4TR5FEWYNKjJQLGqSodap9IOuFA&oe=6AECBA22"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1934382610375855", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974473_1934382613709188_7156337812617042679_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wX1617g0PDgQ7kNvwFlCHfu&_nc_oc=Ado-nA5_ra5dZuhiU5tvlFWnTU7PZBoVdVFJLamCsjD7wSfRa2tja0YWUM1DJNKuKbc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQx3tV8bqojdETrj8KeG4KmaaU4_77aFafGmfI20wACog&oe=6AECA433"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "1524760081483769", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974531_1524760084817102_6497712644828891067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ICKTRBeXEK8Q7kNvwFrbu5E&_nc_oc=AdqO1Nlm81Kdsn3JZTsxLTBYmsHQDvSeFd3JFgR67hyKArMdWQvHkjYEFyt4XWsjaG0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRXLFRJIYOYZ_9yFiLa7u_V3GZX-sQ4VWE9J_gGqDNQ-A&oe=6AECA32F"}, "display_name": "Mystery Box VR: Hidden Secrets", "keywords": [], "long_description": " AN IMMERSIVE VR PUZZLE EXPERIENCE\nInteract with objects, handles, buttons, and wheels on each side. Crack enigmas and collect hidden puzzle tiles on a random side of the boxes.\n\nYou won't be able to compare reality with fiction.\n\n# DISCOVER INVENTIONS\nOnce you unlock all 8 boxes of a Level Pack, you can compose a puzzle and discover a brief history of an invention.\n\nIt's not always easy to escape the room, so use all your IQ to crack the riddles. There's a logic behind all of them, even where it seems it's not!\n\n# IMMERSIVE SOUNDTRACK\nPlay the game with your headphones to get immersed in this amazing adventure.\n\n# HINTS\nGot stuck on some enigma? No worries, you can still get a helpful hint! You can also get in touch with me in case you really can't make it through a riddle, I'll be glad to help ;)\n\n# MULTILANGUAGE\nAvailable in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese.\n\nThe game language will change automatically based on the language settings of your device", "short_description": "A VR escape room game where you have to solve intriguing riddles to open boxes and discover nice stories about popular inventions!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "$R36BSY5.png", "id": "3678762505771822", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031430_3678762509105155_2151975047074617165_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NCIl_6hxvKgQ7kNvwGPhoLK&_nc_oc=AdqUPntlzolpm4Szj64HPoQbui2_3rTUaS9zZE5W8zuyP7QJYs96IQzPfoWQFnq8oiI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR19BEs0vQ8T1h4q8ggOXkp0CpAizSgiOfSjZOKF3RlhQ&oe=6AEC9F25"}, {"file_name": "$R81V725.png", "id": "2720695481426567", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262743_2720695484759900_604086922326600035_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=62DWBcgDEjAQ7kNvwG2q5vU&_nc_oc=AdqiNBQabFamP5zmH025gwmzTvtwN2WFUm5bqt0DDtzwmvvs8TnfP0gKFl9x3EVjnf0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS9bHe5NF0UIrPaRwybeuQq_M_lhjcorkWZeGUDoqOOcQ&oe=6AEC9E0D"}, {"file_name": "$RQ3SN6U.png", "id": "1552311425628973", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982519_1552311428962306_1218130395049083834_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AnPUsIlYtIwQ7kNvwFTVlMg&_nc_oc=AdrGUWD14QUHguDMc7hRqWgdQESixRK_joYwjbcqUNNMMzsrTRpmc6fQrKnVRymYohw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=